#top
nav-bar
.container-fluid
  promo-banner([currentPage]="'hero'")
  //- Promo row
  .row.twilight.has-sparks(style="padding-top:100px; padding-bottom: 100px; position: relative; overflow:hidden;")
    .sparks
    img.promo-spotlight(src="/assets/images/hero-promo-spotlight.svg")
    img(style="width:100%; position: absolute; bottom: -50px;",src="/assets/images/hero-promo-skyline.svg")
    .col-md-11.offset-md-1(style="padding-bottom:25px;")
      h1.big-bold(style="color:#fff;") Answer the Call
    .col-md-1
    .col-md-6
      p.row-xl-pad(style='font-size:1.25em; padding-top: 0px;')
        | Hero unleashes the full power of Edji, giving you unlimited access to all of your Readings, and allowing you to evaluate student engagement and provide powerful feedback right when it’s needed
        | &nbsp;
        span([innerHTML]="':tada:' | emojione")
      .btn-row.text-left
        button#topHeroCTA.btn.btn-lg.btn-hero((click)='goHero("upperCTA")')
          | Go Hero
.container
  .row.row-xl-pad.align-items-top
    .col-sm-4(style='padding-top:21%;')
      .card.card-outline-secondary
        .card-body
          h2.card-title Edji Free
          span.pricing Free
          p.small &nbsp;
          hr
          p.card-text
            //- | Edji Free is an advanced set of reading creation, annotation and discussion tools for easy classroom reading and discussion.
            | 2 Reading Trial
          //- label Who is it for?
          //- p.card-text
          //-   | Teachers that want their class to read occasionally and see their thoughts.
          //- Plan Details
          div(
            *ngFor="let detail of planDetails",
            (click)="detail.info ? triggerInfoModal(detail.info) : null",
            [class.clickable]="detail.info"
          )
            hr
            .label([innerHtml]="detail.label")
            p.card-text.plan-detail
              span([innerHtml]="detail.free | emojione")
              i.icon__tooltip
                span.icon.icon-circle.icon-info  i
        .card-footer
          a.btn.btn-primary.btn-lg.btn-block(*ngIf="!user || !user.isLoggedIn || !user.hero_status", [routerLink]="['/register']")
            | Register
          a.btn.btn-primary.btn-lg.btn-block.disabled(*ngIf="user && user.isLoggedIn && user.hero_status", disabled)
            | {{ user.hero_status ? 'Included' : 'Current Plan'}}
    .col-sm-4
      .card.card-outline-danger
        .card-body
          img.card-img-top(src='/assets/images/hero-lg.png', style="padding-top:15.5%;")
          h2.card-title Edji Hero
          //- $5<span class="small"> / month or </span>
          p.small.hero-color-text(*ngIf="offerDetails")
            i.icon.icon-gift.mr-1
            span([innerHtml]="offerDetails")
          span.pricing
            | $5
            span.small  / month
          p.small Charged annually per teacher
          hr
          p.card-text
            //- | Hero takes the limits off of Edji and gives teachers powerful evaluation and feedback tools to assist and assess their students as they read.
            | Unlimited Readings
          //- label Who is it for?
          //- p.card-text Teachers who make reading a staple of their class and want a detailed history of their classroom engagement
          //- Plan Details
          div(
            *ngFor="let detail of planDetails",
            (click)="detail.info ? triggerInfoModal(detail.info) : null",
            [class.clickable]="detail.info"
          )
            hr
            .label([innerHtml]="detail.label")
            p.card-text.plan-detail
              span([innerHtml]="detail.hero | emojione")
              i.icon__tooltip
                span.icon.icon-circle.icon-info  i
        .card-footer
          a.btn.btn-hero.btn-lg.btn-block(*ngIf="!user || !user.isLoggedIn || !user.hero_status", tabindex='1', (click)='goHero("pricingHeroCard")') Go Hero
          a.btn.btn-hero.btn-lg.btn-block(*ngIf="user && user.isLoggedIn && user.hero_status", [routerLink]="['/account']", [innerHtml]="'Current Plan &nbsp;:tada:' | emojione")
    #academy.col-sm-4
      .card.card-outline-secondary
        .card-body
          img.card-img-top(src='/assets/images/hero-academy-lg.png')
          h2.card-title Academy
          .link.pricing((click)="showRequestAcademyModal = true") Get a Quote
          p.small Starting at $180/yr for 5 licenses
          hr
          p.card-text
            //- | Academy is the easy way to get all your schools' teachers full access to Edji Hero features. Easily get teachers signed on and manage your Academy licenses.
            | For Schools and Districts
          //- label Who is it for?
          //- p.card-text Teachers and Administrators who want to collaborate within their school.
          //- Plan Details
          div(
            *ngFor="let detail of planDetails",
            (click)="detail.info ? triggerInfoModal(detail.info) : null",
            [class.clickable]="detail.info"
          )
            hr
            .label([innerHtml]="detail.label")
            p.card-text.plan-detail
              span([innerHtml]="detail.academy | emojione")
              i.icon__tooltip
                span.icon.icon-circle.icon-info  i
        .card-footer
          button.btn.btn-primary.btn-lg.btn-block((click)="showRequestAcademyModal = true") Get Quote
